From ecdb90b25c5378e668b59c3985c18442bf0ee3cb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 04:01:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Analytic foliage coverage and three-quarter AO (F-223A)

- hdAlphaAASharp 2 = analytic coverage: the alpha's fine derivatives
  extrapolate it to each standard sample position and the samples that
  pass go to gl_SampleMask, alpha to coverage off (key bit 5, module
  "#an<N>"); modules the patch cannot take fall back to sharp coverage
- AO work grid scale is now a fraction (num<<8|den): hdAOResolution
  0 full / 1 three-quarter / 2 half (default) / 3 quarter, replacing
  hdAOHalfRes

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UHcJJVC4feQ4s15e9bNRoN
